---
import clinic from '../assets/tb-clinic.jpg';
import outreach from '../assets/tb-outreach.jpg';
---
<article>
  <header class="program-opening content-wrap"><a class="eyebrow" href="/our-impact">← Our Impact</a><div class="program-title"><h1>Tibetan<br /><em>TB Program</em></h1><div><span class="program-label">Public health · Community care</span><p>Decades of tuberculosis diagnosis, treatment, prevention and community outreach.</p><a class="text-link" href="/find-care/tb-care">Looking for TB care? →</a></div></div></header>
  <figure class="program-landscape content-wrap"><img src={clinic.src} width={clinic.width} height={clinic.height} alt="A healthcare worker reviewing an X-ray outside Delek’s TB clinic" /><figcaption>Clinical care at Delek’s TB clinic.</figcaption></figure>
  <div class="program-body content-wrap"><aside class="program-index"><span class="eyebrow">In this program</span><a href="#beginnings">How it began</a><a href="#community">Beyond the hospital</a><a href="#continued-care">Care that continues</a></aside><div class="program-story"><section id="beginnings"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Our beginnings</span><h2>A lasting commitment<br />to tuberculosis care.</h2><p class="lead">Delek’s TB program brings clinical care and community support together.</p><p>A dedicated program began in 1980, followed by the TB ward and outpatient clinic in 1982. Over the years, diagnosis, treatment, research and prevention have become connected parts of this work.</p></section><section id="community"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Community outreach</span><h2>Reaching people<br />where they live and learn.</h2><p>Community health workers and partnerships help extend care beyond the hospital. Active case finding and contact tracing bring screening closer to schools, monasteries, nunneries and other community settings.</p><figure class="outreach-photo"><img src={outreach.src} width={outreach.width} height={outreach.height} alt="Community screening conducted outdoors by healthcare workers" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Taking screening closer to the community.</figcaption></figure><div class="program-principles"><div><h3>Find earlier</h3><p>Bring screening closer to the community.</p></div><div><h3>Stay connected</h3><p>Support treatment and continued follow-up.</p></div><div><h3>Prevent together</h3><p>Connect education, prevention and care.</p></div></div></section><section id="continued-care"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Continued care</span><h2>People at the heart<br />of the program.</h2><p>Diagnosis is one part of a longer journey. Delek’s work combines clinical services with community-based treatment and support, helping patients remain connected to care.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-impact/zero-tb-in-kids">Explore Zero TB in Tibetan Kids →</a></section></div></div>
  <footer class="program-next content-wrap"><div><span class="eyebrow">Take the next step</span><h2>Find care.<br />Support the work.</h2></div><div class="program-next-links"><a href="/find-care/tb-care"><span>TB clinic & patient information</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/support"><span>Support Delek</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/our-impact"><span>Explore all programs</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></footer>
</article>
<style>
.outreach-photo{margin:32px 0}.outreach-photo img{width:100%;height:auto;max-height:420px;object-fit:cover}.outreach-photo figcaption{font-size:12px;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-top:10px}.program-opening{padding-block:64px 48px}.program-title{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:end;margin-top:32px}.program-title h1{font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,90px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.045em}.program-title em{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:400}.program-title p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.6;margin-block:16px 24px}.program-label{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.program-landscape{margin-block:0 56px}.program-landscape img{width:100%;height:360px;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 15%}.program-landscape figcaption{font-size:12px;color:var(--color-text-muted);padding-top:12px;line-height:1.6}.program-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}.program-index{position:sticky;top:112px}.program-index a{display:block;font-size:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #deded5}.program-story section{padding-block:16px 64px;scroll-margin-top:110px}.program-story h2,.program-next h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,43px);letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:500;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:28px}.program-story p{color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px;max-width:65ch}.program-story .lead{font-size:23px;color:var(--color-primary);line-height:1.6}.program-principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:32px;padding-top:28px;border-top:2px solid var(--color-accent)}.program-principles h3{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}.program-principles p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.program-next{border-top:1px solid #dcded4;padding-block:48px 72px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px}.program-next-links a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dcded4;color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:500}
@media(max-width:767px){.program-opening{padding-block:40px 32px}.program-title{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.program-title p{font-size:18px}.program-landscape img{height:260px}.program-body{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.program-index{position:static}.program-index a{display:inline-block;margin-right:20px}.program-story section{padding-bottom:36px}.program-principles{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.program-next{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}}
</style>
